Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: bluez, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-egl1, libegl1, libgl1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ianmarmour/Ferry
Description: Text from your computer through your iPhone
 Ferry brings your iPhone's messages to your desktop over Bluetooth. Read
 your conversations, reply, and start new ones with anyone in your contacts,
 in a window styled after Messages on the Mac.
 .
 It talks to the phone the way a car does, so there's no app to install on
 the iPhone, no Mac to relay through and no cloud service in between.
